; Unused debug: leave the room warp mode
;
; Jumped to by the debug room warp #R$83CE when key T (control bit 5) is pressed: sets the player state back to 4,
; standing (it was $FF, the warp mode). Never reached in normal play.
@label=DebugLeaveWarp
@isub=LD A,PLAYER_STANDING
c$AD82 LD A,$04      ; player state standing
 $AD84 LD ($A894),A  ;
 $AD87 RET           ;
